      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changed fillColor to white and android:tint to accent_device_default.\n\nThe use case here is for share sheet to tint the bluetooth icon to the user chosen accent color. We can\u0027t reference theme attributes in this drawable because icons referenced in androidmanifest xml are inflated without a theme.\n\nAnother option would be to add custom logic into share sheet for specifically the bluetooth icon to tint it, but I think the current implementation is cleaner.",
